    "detailed_description": "This game is purely for catharsis; there's no main storyline and it will never conclude.<br />\r\n&quot;9Shot&quot; is a first-person shooter game set in a zombie-infested Tokyo streets . Your objective is simple: survive against waves of zombies for as long as possible. Earn points by killing zombies to upgrade weapons<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEndless Zombie Onslaught<br />\r\nExperience relentless zombie spawns in a time-unlimited game mode, where the frequency of zombie appearances progressively increases until players can no longer endure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInfinite Weapon Upgrades<br />\r\nScore points by slaying zombies to continuously upgrade your weapon's abilities, with no limit to their potential",
